<x-layout :title="$pageContent->title" :description="$pageContent->description">
<x-page-intro :page-content="$pageContent"/>
<x-legal-content scope="privacy"/>
<section class="section section-tight">
    <div class="container prose">
        <h2>Website measurement</h2>
        <p>We count enquiry form starts and clicks on booking, WhatsApp, email and phone links to understand how visitors choose to contact us. The measurement database stores daily totals by action. It does not store the visitor’s identity, IP address or contact details in those totals or set a separate analytics cookie.</p>
        <p>If you allow optional analytics, we retain campaign tags and source categories for your first and most recent identifiable visits in your site session and save them with any enquiry you submit. When Google Analytics is configured, it uses analytics cookies to measure page views, contact link clicks and successful enquiries. You can change your choice under Analytics preferences in the footer.</p>
        <p>We use saved enquiry records to count successful submissions and track follow-up, such as qualifications, consultations booked and proposals sent. When you choose an external booking or messaging service, that provider handles your activity under its own privacy policy.</p>
    </div>
</section>
</x-layout>
